      "answer": "The command to evaluate accuracy using lm_eval with vLLM is:  \n```bash  \nlm_eval --model vllm --model_args pretrained=\"./Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct-W4A16-G128\",add_bos_token=True --tasks gsm8k --num_fewshot 5 --limit 250  \n```  \nThis command is used in both int4 and int8 quantization scenarios."
